# What `ts deploy` ships, as an rsync filter file (first match wins): the
# compiled server, the package files the box installs from, and the systemd
# unit. Everything else is neither shipped nor deleted on the box, including
# its node_modules (installed there, without dev dependencies) and logs/.
#
# Never shipped, from anywhere: ~/.config/imitation/config.toml (the bot token
# and API key, copied by hand once) and ~/.local/state/imitation (sessions and
# profiles, which live only on the box).
+ /dist/***
+ /package.json
+ /package-lock.json
+ /deployed.json
+ /deploy/
+ /deploy/imitation.service
- *
